---@field go_table LuckyTriadsView_GoTable
---@field cardItems LuckyTriadsView._obj_card1_GoTable[]    卡牌节点
---@field activeConditionItems LuckyTriadsView._obj_condition_GoTable[]     @使用中的条件节点
---@field releaseConditionItems LuckyTriadsView._obj_condition_GoTable[]    @未使用中的条件节点
